      "blocked_by_source": " every required leaf below. #1 is the parent coverage tracker, not a prerequisite whose closure precedes this gate.\n\n- [ ] #4 \u2014 SC-01: Inventory contracts and record authoritative producer and consumer ownership\n- [ ] #5 \u2014 SC-02: Establish canonical JSON Schemas, generated ESM types and offline validators\n- [ ] #6 \u2014 SC-03: Define compatibility, versioning, deprecation and immutable consumer pins\n- [ ] #7 \u2014 SC-04: Standardize scoped identities, correlation, provenance and ID assignment\n- [ ] #8 \u2014 SC-11: Specify field privacy, evidence projection and stable hashing rules\n- [ ] #9 \u2014 SC-08A: Define typed error, partial-failure and blocking envelopes\n- [ ] #10 \u2014 SC-08B: Define async job status, progress, cancellation and resume envelopes\n- [ ] #11 \u2014 SC-06A: Define UsageEvent and operation, provider, transport and billed attempt semantics\n- [ ] #12 \u2014 SC-06B: Define BudgetReservation commands, decisions and uncertain-attempt bindings\n- [ ] #13 \u2014 SC-06C: Define FinancialSummary precision, coverage and reconciliation projection\n- [ ] #14 \u2014 SC-05: Specify injected DecisionPort, JEV result variants and DecisionReceipt\n- [ ] #15 \u2014 SC-C01: Define ProjectRequest and trusted application-to-harness ingress\n- [ ] #16 \u2014 SC-C02: Define ResearchRequest with bounded scope, policy and evidence expectations\n- [ ] #17 \u2014 SC-C03: Define EventIntelligencePackage with facts, uncertainty and permitted assets\n- [ ] #18 \u2014 SC-C08: Define research correction and invalidation events with immutable references\n- [ ] #19 \u2014 SC-C04: Define CreativeBrief with exact facts, visual intent and bounded model policy\n- [ ] #20 \u2014 SC-C05: Define DesignControlSchema allowlists and safe declarative values\n- [ ] #21 \u2014 SC-C06: Define immutable DesignVersion identity, lineage and artwork references\n- [ ] #22 \u2014 SC-07A: Define externally issued ApprovalReference and ApprovalReceipt binding\n- [ ] #23 \u2014 SC-07B: Define ArtifactHandoffManifest for exact approved artwork transfer\n- [ ] #24 \u2014 SC-07C: Define ProductionBundle output composition and preflight manifest\n- [ ] #25 \u2014 SC-07D: Define FulfillmentQuote identity, applicability and exact monetary terms\n- [ ] #26 \u2014 SC-07E: Define OrderAuthorization bound to exact quote, purchase terms and bundle\n- [ ] #27 \u2014 SC-08C: Define normalized fulfillment status and duplicate observation envelopes\n- [ ] #28 \u2014 SC-C07: Define EvaluationEvidence with pinned revisions and sanitized proof references\n- [ ] #29 \u2014 SC-09: Build canonical positive, negative and cross-consumer contract fixture harness\n- [ ] #30 \u2014 SC-10: Publish discoverable catalog, generated-type guidance and consumer migration handoff"
